<title>CANADA: Sidus Systems Q3 shr net turns to prof.</title>
<headline>Sidus Systems Q3 shr net turns to prof.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Aug 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.03     loss	C$0.26</p>
